index 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000..2f79efc1b2a3f2821bea21ac461b70ef73a0c7f8
--- /dev/null
+++ b/styles/709-712-prompts.txt
@@ -0,0 +1,14 @@
+Generated using the built-in image_gen tool. All images generated fresh from text without reference images.
+
+709-spider-man-pointing.png
+Generate a fresh square illustration, 1024 by 1024 pixels. Retro hand-drawn cel animation comedy. Two identical women, each age 32, stand facing one another in a city alley, both pointing one index finger at the other in surprise. Large three-quarter-length figures fill the composition. Each has curly auburn shoulder-length hair, freckles, round tortoiseshell glasses, and a mustard-yellow knit sweater layered over a red-and-blue costume with thin spiderweb line patterns on the sleeves and leggings. Red-and-blue fabric hoods have large face openings; their glasses and curls show clearly. One holds a mug of coffee in her free hand. A croissant is on a ledge nearby. Original cartoon characters with expressive angular poses and simplified anatomy. Flat vivid cel colors, bold black outlines, spare shadow shapes, a hand-painted alley background, old television animation aesthetic. No emblems or logos anywhere. No text, captions, signatures or watermarks. Use no reference images.
+
+710-surprised-pikachu.png
+Create one fresh 1024x1024 square image entirely from this text, using no reference images. Use case: illustration-story. The Surprised Pikachu reaction meme redrawn as a HUMAN WOMAN, not as a yellow creature. An extreme close-up fills almost the whole square with her comically shocked face: mouth is a perfect round O, eyes are enormous empty wide circles with tiny simple pupils and a blank stunned stare, frozen reaction pose. She is a woman in her early 30s with curly auburn shoulder-length hair, freckles, round tortoiseshell glasses, and a mustard-yellow knit sweater just visible at the bottom. Her curls form a cropped silhouette around the upper corners and sides; her freckles and glasses remain very readable. A small portion of a coffee cup enters at the bottom edge and a tiny nearby croissant can peek in at that same edge. Authentic simple late-1990s TV anime reaction-frame drawing: flat hand-drawn anime colors, firm dark outlines, minimal detail, almost no shading, cel-animation abstraction, pale soft green background. The flat anime style fully determines exaggerated proportions and expression; she should be human but the instantly recognizable huge-eyed O-mouth shocked meme reaction is the priority. No photorealism or realistic anatomy rendering. No yellow creature, ears, animal features, text, captions, signatures, logos or watermarks.
+
+711-deep-fried-meme.png
+Create one fresh 1024x1024 square image entirely from this text, using no reference images. Use case: stylized-concept. An authentic absurdly deep-fried internet meme image, intentionally hideously overprocessed as though repeatedly screenshotted, sharpened, saturated and JPEG-compressed. A woman in her early 30s with curly auburn shoulder-length hair, freckles, round tortoiseshell glasses and mustard-yellow knit sweater enjoys coffee, with a croissant nearby. She is HUGE and prominent in a chaotic, very tight tilted low-angle three-quarter view leaning over a cafe table, coffee mug up close near the lens, a croissant large at a lower edge. Make the deep-fried aesthetic the dominant medium: giant crushed JPEG macroblocks, severe chromatic bleed, nuclear orange red yellow and electric cyan oversaturation, pitch-black crushed shadows, blown white highlights, brutal contrast, thick sharpening ringing/halos on every contour, random starburst lens flares, intensely glowing eyes visible through glasses, coarse digital noise and posterized bands. Frame is slightly tilted, visually loud, ugly-funny, unmistakably an old repeatedly reposted deep-fried meme artifact. Her auburn curls, freckles and glasses are identifiable and the mustard sweater and coffee stay visible underneath the damage. Distinct compressed raster chaos rather than a clean illustration with a light filter. No text of any kind, no captions, no impact font, no letters, no labels, no signature, no watermark, no logos.
+
+712-roll-safe.png
+Create one fresh 1024x1024 square image entirely from this text, using no reference images. Use case: photorealistic-natural. Recreate the Roll Safe meme photograph gesture and expression with an original adult woman: she taps one index finger against her temple, gives the camera a knowing slightly crooked closed-mouth smile with one eyebrow subtly raised, as if she has just thought of a clever loophole. She is in her early 30s with curly auburn shoulder-length hair, freckles, round tortoiseshell glasses and a mustard-yellow knit sweater. Her other hand holds a coffee mug naturally in front of her lower torso; a croissant sits nearby on the cafe counter at the bottom of frame. Tight waist-up candid snapshot with her large and prominent, body slightly turned and face turned toward the camera, tapping finger beside the temple clearly visible. Warm indoor cafe light, everyday out-of-focus interior, slightly soft inexpensive camera/video snapshot quality, mild grain, natural skin texture, subtle imperfect focus, warm realistic colors. Let this meme-photo pose and snapshot aesthetic dictate the whole image. It should look like a believable casually captured reaction photograph, not a polished fashion portrait. No text, no captions, no words, no lettering on cup or background, no logos, no signatures, no watermarks.
+

